        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "。由於真不擅長戰鬥，最後死在了戰場。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7498,
        "name": "狐齋宮",
        "desc": "<p>出身於白辰一族的狐狸，被人們奉為仙狐。在五百年前的災厄中逝世。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/05/28/368338997/6210c045499fd0426d40e6aa35ebe9b8_2925125565352402737.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
