      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7499,
        "name": "天狗笹百合",
        "desc": "<p><span>天狗族人，幕府軍大將。兩千年前在與大蛇奧羅巴斯的戰爭中陣亡。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/06/01/368338997/7d0fc35fadabb2d128809d157fdeac84_4144792763627666416.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
