        "epId": 4908,
        "name": "奧羅巴斯",
        "desc": "<p>魔神戰爭的失敗者，被雷神「無想的一刀」斬殺的巨蛇魔神。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/01/7998136/747288a2c90b1de20ed1f9e1b4938d72_5818948546436094933.png",
